{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.BlochSuslinComplex","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BlochSuslinComplex","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Knot.KummerUnitCircle"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.figure8_from_rigidity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.figure8_from_rigidity","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochSuslinComplex.lean#L112-L123","doc":"**The full chain, conditional on the two classical inputs.**  Any\ncontinuous `τ_arch` with the Bloch–Wigner symmetries and the five-term\nrelation gives the figure-8 value up to one real scalar. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.figure8_calibration_complex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.figure8_calibration_complex","kind":"theorem","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochSuslinComplex.lean#L88-L110","doc":"**Figure-8 calibration at the genuine shape `e^{iπ/3}`.**  If `τ_arch` is a\nmultiple `c` of the Bloch–Wigner function, then at the regular ideal\ntetrahedron `τ_arch(e^{iπ/3}) = c · Cl₂(π/3)`, so two tetrahedra give\n`c · Vol(4₁) = c · 2 Cl₂(π/3)`.  The value of `D` here is a theorem, not an\ninput. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.archimedean_functor_uniqueness_complex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.archimedean_functor_uniqueness_complex","kind":"theorem","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochSuslinComplex.lean#L80-L86","doc":"**Uniqueness of the archimedean realisation (conditional, complex form).** ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.real_slice_eq_zero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.real_slice_eq_zero","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochSuslinComplex.lean#L72-L78","doc":"**Why the real slice carries nothing.**  The conjugation symmetry alone\nforces `f x = 0` at every real `x`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BlochSuslinRigidity.uniqueness","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BlochSuslinRigidity.uniqueness","kind":"theorem","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochSuslinComplex.lean#L68-L68","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BlochSuslinRigidity.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BlochSuslinRigidity.mk","kind":"ctor","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochSuslinComplex.lean#L67-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BlochSuslinRigidity","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BlochSuslinRigidity","kind":"class","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochSuslinComplex.lean#L64-L70","doc":"**Classical input 2 (rigidity):** every function on `ℂ \\ {0,1}` that is\ncontinuous, has the Bloch–Wigner symmetries and satisfies the five-term\nrelation is a real multiple of `D`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BlochWignerFiveTerm.five_term","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BlochWignerFiveTerm.five_term","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochSuslinComplex.lean#L62-L62","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BlochWignerFiveTerm.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BlochWignerFiveTerm.mk","kind":"ctor","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochSuslinComplex.lean#L61-L61","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BlochWignerFiveTerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BlochWignerFiveTerm","kind":"class","line":60,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochSuslinComplex.lean#L60-L62","doc":"**Classical input 1:** `D` satisfies the five-term relation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BlochSymmetric.conj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BlochSymmetric.conj","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochSuslinComplex.lean#L58-L58","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BlochSymmetric.inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BlochSymmetric.inv","kind":"theorem","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochSuslinComplex.lean#L57-L57","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BlochSymmetric.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BlochSymmetric.mk","kind":"ctor","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochSuslinComplex.lean#L56-L56","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.BlochSymmetric","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.BlochSymmetric","kind":"structure","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochSuslinComplex.lean#L55-L58","doc":"The two symmetries of the Bloch–Wigner function. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.SuslinFiveTerm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.SuslinFiveTerm","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/BlochSuslinComplex.lean#L50-L53","doc":"The **five-term relation in Suslin's orientation**, on `ℂ \\ {0,1}`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}